## 1️⃣ Features of YouTube as a Cloud Service

YouTube is a cloud-based video-sharing platform that provides the following features:

1. **Cloud Storage** – Videos are stored online without using local storage.
2. **On-Demand Access** – Videos can be accessed anytime from anywhere using the internet.
3. **Scalability** – Supports millions of users and videos without performance issues.
4. **Video Streaming** – Allows smooth playback of videos without downloading.
5. **Content Sharing** – Users can share videos using links or embeds.
6. **Automatic Video Processing** – Converts videos into multiple resolutions automatically.
7. **User Management** – Allows creators to manage channels, playlists, and subscribers.
8. **Security & Privacy Controls** – Provides options like Public, Private, and Unlisted videos.
9. **Analytics** – Shows views, watch time, and audience engagement.
10. **Free Service** – Uploading and viewing videos is free.

---

## 2️⃣ Steps to Upload an Educational Video on YouTube

1. Open a web browser and go to **[www.youtube.com](http://www.youtube.com)**.
2. **Sign in** using your Google account.
3. Click on the **Create (+)** button at the top right corner.
4. Select **Upload Video**.
5. Click **Select Files** and choose your educational video from the computer.
6. Enter the **Title** and **Description** of the video.
7. Choose the **Audience** (e.g., “No, it’s not made for kids”).
8. Add **Tags** (optional) to improve search visibility.
9. Click **Next** until you reach the visibility settings.
10. Click **Publish** to upload the video.

---

## 3️⃣ Appropriate Settings to Make the Video Public

To make the video visible to everyone:

1. Set **Visibility** to **Public**.
2. Ensure the video has a **clear title and description**.
3. Select an appropriate **Thumbnail**.
4. Disable restrictions unless necessary.
5. Enable **Comments** (optional) for interaction.
6. Click **Publish**.

---

## ✅ Conclusion

YouTube is a powerful cloud service that allows users to upload, store, and share educational videos easily. By using proper upload steps and selecting public visibility settings, educational content can be shared globally.

